Finding 7
Missing Subresource Integrity (SRI)
Using remote artifacts without integrity checks increases the risk of executing malicious or altered code within an application. Attackers can modify these artifacts before they are downloaded, injecting harmful code that compromises security on both client and server sides.
(Affected Source File/Line number: None specified)
